@startuml
title Action 域用例图
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor 求职者 as User
actor "Job 域" as Job
actor "Roadmap 域" as Roadmap
actor "CV 域" as CV
actor "Behavioral 域" as Behavioral

rectangle "Job Helper / Action" {
  usecase "UC-ACT-001\n查看今日优先 Action\n和新职位" as UC1
  usecase "UC-ACT-002\n从 Action 进入源对象" as UC2
  usecase "UC-ACT-003\n根据源对象变化\n同步 Action" as UC3
  usecase "UC-ACT-004\n置顶、完成、忽略\n或恢复 Action" as UC4
  usecase "UC-ACT-005\n解释 Action 优先级" as UC5
  usecase "幂等消费领域事件" as Event
  usecase "计算可解释优先级" as Priority
}

User --> UC1
User --> UC2
User --> UC4
User --> UC5
Job --> UC3
Roadmap --> UC3
CV --> UC3
Behavioral --> UC3

UC3 ..> Event : <<include>>
UC3 ..> Priority : <<include>>
UC1 ..> Priority : <<include>>
UC5 ..> Priority : <<include>>

note right of Priority
  deadline → blocker → user pin
  → system suggestion；
  无不透明总分。
end note

note bottom of UC2
  导航不等于完成，
  不改变 Job 状态或提交申请。
end note

note bottom of UC4
  操作: PIN/UNPIN/COMPLETE/
  IGNORE/RESTORE；
  用户决定优先于系统重算；
  AI 不能伪造用户决定。
end note
@enduml
